    <!-- The lever catalogue: one phrase per position, read by the pre-game screen and by
         the notification a rule fires. It states a state and never an event, because the
         same phrase serves both: "2 lives", never "you lose a life". Any voice belongs to
         the staging phrase, which the author of a scene writes on the patch. -->
